  "label": "Ilhan Omar",
  "description": "Ilhan Omar is a Somali-American politician and the first Somali-American woman elected to the U.S. Congress. She is a member of the Democratic Party and represents Minnesota's 5th congressional district. Her identity as a Black Muslim woman is central to the meme's targeting and the stereotypes it invokes. The meme falsely accuses her of tax fraud, which is a real-world legal issue but is presented in a degrading context.",
